              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मैच — maic — \"a match (a game)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कल शाम को क्रिकेट का मैच है। Kal śām ko krikeṭ kā maic hai. There is a cricket match tomorrow evening."
